  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "有你在还会安静吗  (Never This Quiet Around You)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside the hushed office, Chun Yuqiao wakes briefly after Bu Xiaogu changes his drip, and even weak from illness he cannot resist teasing her about peace and quiet. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚换药了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说不清。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说不清就别说了，闭上眼睛，再休息一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "屋子从来都没有这么安静过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是啊，你一病啊，整个公司都特别安静。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不会吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有你在的地方，还会安静？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不明白。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚换药了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your medicine was just changed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说不清。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot explain it clearly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说不清就别说了，闭上眼睛，再休息一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If it is hard to explain, do not talk—close your eyes and rest a while longer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "屋子从来都没有这么安静过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This room has never been this quiet before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是啊，你一病啊，整个公司都特别安静。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Indeed—the moment you fell ill, the entire company went remarkably quiet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不会吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That cannot be true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有你在的地方，还会安静？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can any place ever stay quiet with you around?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不明白。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no idea what you mean.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚换药了。",
      "gap": 0.5
